# Trusted OpenPGP fingerprints for https://pkgs.omamobile.org/
# (Omarchy Mobile, extracted from the omamobile-keyring package the repo
# publishes). Signatures are made by the release key's signing SUBKEY, so
# the fingerprint check accepts the subkey's fingerprint as well as the
# primary's: see the key package's README (packages/omamobile-keyring).
#
# primary "Omarchy Mobile Package Signing" (2026-10-12, signs keyring pkg)
6C84FE3D240709E70E27CC94B301F5EA62B249FE
# primary "Omarchy Mobile Release Key" (2026-10-26, certifies only)
20567593566EEEE2DD8864608632C8075EB94673
# its ed25519 signing subkey (the one that actually makes the .sig files)
DDBA4581E0178D33DB69973F7F1041BF47291504
